逃しやすいので、目尻に注目していただければ......！\n額の三日月は、髪の間から（ぼんやりと）透けて見える。\n肉球、耳の内側、翼のグラデーションはすべて同じ色です。\n尻尾が4本ある。\nアホ毛\n\nこの度はありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Yge3Dg909QF12Kx7NWmdoPf_I0Zt1CtY", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_Mochamoru_/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b496eb8/uploads/origins/aa02062b-5c6a-435f-8321-be6f446522a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22210c7d22bd0c49457e2cd028425d03", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b496eb8/uploads/origins/aa02062b-5c6a-435f-8321-be6f446522a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22210c7d22bd0c49457e2cd028425d03, https://si.imgix.net/8b496eb8/uploads/origins/aa02062b-5c6a-435f-8321-be6f446522a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=222bbf9c5b8086ef63568d2cfecb7656 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b496eb8/uploads/origins/aa02062b-5c6a-435f-8321-be6f446522a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19984b0590f03e6be2b659beae2296ff 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like you to draw my little wolf boy!\nHe is a sweet, playful and flirty boy, and has big paws!\nPose and details are up to you!\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/ptegh93iamd1ay1hh2dq5/h?rlkey=3d0nfy6wb2adchut9h65s0hlb&st=kc1ctl94&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_Mochamoru_/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e09b0c2a/uploads/origins/1c931006-4879-4014-a6cd-13c6e7346040?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=030ef49618271c2bfa3d61c1a62aee13", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e09b0c2a/uploads/origins/1c931006-4879-4014-a6cd-13c6e7346040?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=030ef49618271c2bfa3d61c1a62aee13, https://si.imgix.net/e09b0c2a/uploads/origins/1c931006-4879-4014-a6cd-13c6e7346040?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&f